ense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `.github/workflows/reconcile-bridge.yml:1-41,85-111,158-162,234-253,282-287,311-336,359-415` — Preserve reconciliation direction, full-history store, signing, pass lock, authoring identity, failure artifacts, single successor scheduling, trusted dispatch inputs, 0/1 CloudWatch contract. Consumer: GitHub Actions/rebar reconciler.\n- `.github/workflows/release.yml:3-39,83-114,163-174,300-359,381-393,456-507` — Preserve tag/manual authorization, dependency and metadata gates, build-once artifacts, trusted publishing/attestations, registry validation, evidence fragments. Consumer: GitHub Actions/release operators.\n- `.github/workflows/structured-output-baseline.yml:3-16,104-114` — Preserve manual, billable, capped provider matrix; raw outputs and scores; per-test guard. Consumer: GitHub Actions/evaluation operators.\n- `.github/workflows/terraform-drift.yml:1-17` — Preserve scheduled/manual read-only plan, no push trigger, OIDC role. Consumer: GitHub Actions/Terraform operators.\n- `.github/workflows/test.yml:3-35,61-92,118-151,194-212,229-239,258-282,329-426` — Preserve trigger policy, reusable gates, external-test credential mapping, clean-install probe, health report, exact matrix/platform guarantees, docs link gate. Consumer: GitHub Actions.\n- `.github/workflows/verify-identity.yml:3-26,47-53,83-88` — Preserve whole-store authenticated authorship, tickets-branch checkout, temporary exception and explicit removal condition. Consumer: GitHub Actions.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":".github/workflows/reconcile-bridge.yml","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":".github/workflows/release.yml","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":".github/workflows/structured-output-baseline.yml","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":".github/workflows/terraform-drift.yml","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":".github/workflows/test.yml","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":".github/workflows/verify-identity.yml","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","49ac-d7e5-f383-4d7f"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"49ac-d7e5-f383-4d7f","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"760e-8033-ada8-4bc5","ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in .github/workflows — cohort 02: reconcile-bridge–verify-identity","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["798cfde7-2315-4d2b-be23-f1dd7f627fd6","65f1f589-002a-4818-95eb-577a47ebdcf8","359e3125-143b-4171-b15a-fed9a9e2ed68","a